    "outputs": [],
    "tags": null,
    "doc": [
        "The ESLoad actor is used for loading data into Elasticsearch.",
        "It allows users to provide input data in the form of an array of objects ('maps'), where each object corresponds to a record to be indexed.",
        "The input 'id' specifies a unique identifier that links each document to its corresponding record in Elasticsearch, and 'index' defines the target index for the documents.",
        "This actor is essential for efficiently moving data to Elasticsearch while ensuring synchronization and accurate handling of errors."
    ]
